{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣媒體引述供應鏈人士稱，台積電正考慮再次上調CoWoS先進封裝報價，漲幅可能達到10%至20%；晶圓代工廠和封裝測試廠也在評估類似調整。台積電尚未證實這項漲價消息。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584190.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T14:01:08.504674+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T13:41:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T13:58:15.653870+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T13:58:15.653870+00:00","content_hash":"360e7472f7a794ed6af604aee6b3612bde06430638f922fb24a85c3d2584ca2b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}